  "body": "## What changed\n\n`main`'s `camcraft-app` test build is broken. PR #147 added `Operation.coolant`, but `tests/drilling_cross_holder.rs` (#119) and `tests/drilling_cross_part.rs` (#117) were written before it, so their `Operation { … }` literals miss the field (E0063). Both now set `coolant: Default::default()`. A search found no other literal without it.\n\n## Readings\n\n`cargo test -p camcraft-app -p camcraft-ui -p camcraft-motion -p camcraft-sim -p camcraft-post --no-run`: every test target builds. drilling_cross_holder 2 and drilling_cross_part 3 pass.\n\nChangelog: none\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
